    "explanation": "Both parties agree the vehicle left the recommended line (Yishun Avenue 2 – Yishun Avenue 1 – Seletar Road – Sengkang West Avenue) for Yio Chu Kang Road and Jalan Kayu between 13:28:02 and 13:35:58, and both agree the platform's own distances fix the size of that detour. Under POL-RD-22 the deviation is EV-TRIP-05007's actual 8.3 km minus its recommended 7.3 km = 1.00 km, and a deviation of 1.0 km or less is within tolerance. The GPS trace (EV-GPS-05007) traces only 6.996 km over 34 fixes and, per POL-RD-22, shows which route was taken but is not used to re-measure distance, so the recorded 1.00 km stands. On justification, the only traffic data on file (EV-ADVIS-05007-01, Seletar Road, both directions, covering the trip window) is type NONE with speed bands 5-6 — no incident, roadwork or closure — so under POL-RD-23 the reroute is not traffic-justified; the driver's 'Jalan Kayu is smoother' is a preference, not a justification the clause recognises. On notice, EV-CHAT-05007 is complete with 0 messages and the trip record carries no in-app calls or call recording, so under POL-RD-21 the driver cannot establish he informed the rider. Those findings do not change the outcome: POL-RD-24 selects exactly one row, and the row this record fits is (e) — not traffic-justified, deviation 1 km or less — which pays no refund because the deviation is within tolerance. Row (c) (traffic-justified, uninformed, 1 km or less) would also pay nothing, so the refund question does not turn on the notification failure. Rows (b) and (d), which would refund the excess distance fare, both require a deviation over 1 km, and 1.00 km is not over 1 km. Were a refund due it would be 1.00 km x 0.72 SGD/km = 0.72 SGD (EV-FARE-05007), not the 2.50 SGD claimed, but no row pays it. I reject the rider's request to escalate under POL-GEN-26 on rounding: POL-RD-22 defines the deviation by the platform's recorded distances, every artifact is COMPLETE at weight_multiplier 1.0 with no issue codes fired, and the tolerance test therefore runs and returns 'within tolerance' — the fact is established, not missing or impaired. The disputed value is 2.50 SGD, below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD band, so the AI ruling is final; no fraud flag is present (0 on both sides) and confidence 0.90 meets the 0.80 POL-RD-25 requires, the 2 km limb not being in force (ai_ruling_max_deviation_applied false). The present state stands and the 12.65 SGD metered fare charged is not returned.",
    "referrals": []
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}
